{"id":"ceab247000d7caa9","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets.md","title":"可计算集合有有效的 c.e. 索引全列举","display":"thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets — 可计算集合有有效的 c.e. 索引全列举","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets","aliases":["20-thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets"],"display":"thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets — 可计算集合有有效的 c.e. 索引全列举","chapter":"2","section":"2.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.6.8","source_printed_pages":[48],"source_pdf_pages":[84],"depends_on":["[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets — 可计算集合有有效的 c.e. 索引全列举"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.6.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>48</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>84</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；集合列用 c.e. 索引表示。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ [\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathsf{Arg}_k\\}]\">\\(\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ [\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathsf{Arg}_k\\}]\\)</span> 为上游的全函数限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}index\\text{-}list\\text{-}computable\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\{W_{f(e)}:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal R].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}index\\text{-}list\\text{-}computable\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\{W_{f(e)}:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal R].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_e:=\\{x\\in\\omega:\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=1\\land\\forall y\\le x\\ [\\varphi_e(y)\\downarrow]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_e:=\\{x\\in\\omega:\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=1\\land\\forall y\\le x\\ [\\varphi_e(y)\\downarrow]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这个集合族统一 c.e.：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x\">\\(e,x\\)</span>，并行模拟有限多个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(y)\">\\(\\varphi_e(y)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\le x\">\\(y\\le x\\)</span>），等它们全部停止；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(x)=1\">\\(\\varphi_e(x)=1\\)</span> 就停止，否则永久运行。s-m-n 因而给全可计算指标函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{f(e)}=R_e\">\\(W_{f(e)}=R_e\\)</span>，且不改变既定程序编号或阶段枚举。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 不是全函数，取最小发散输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_0\">\\(y_0\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_e\\subseteq\\{x:x&lt;y_0\\}\">\\(R_e\\subseteq\\{x:x&lt;y_0\\}\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_e\">\\(R_e\\)</span> 有限且可计算。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 全定义，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_e=\\{x:\\varphi_e(x)=1\\}\">\\(R_e=\\{x:\\varphi_e(x)=1\\}\\)</span>，直接运行全程序即可判定成员，所以仍可计算。反过来，任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(B\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\chi_B\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\chi_B\\)</span> 的索引，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_e=B\">\\(R_e=B\\)</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{W_{f(e)}:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal R\">\\(\\{W_{f(e)}:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal R\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>这里全可计算的是产生 c.e. 索引的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>；没有统一产生各行的特征索引，也不需要判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 是否全定义或找出其最小发散输入。两种情形只用于数学验证，因此不违反总可计算函数不可有效全列举的对角定理。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.6.8；印刷页 48；PDF 第 84 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc75264a5ecdc3fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc75264a5ecdc3fb","anch